WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:04.119
Monday morning. Hydration sales are down twelve percent.

00:00:04.119 --> 00:00:06.593
The team has the number. But what's the story?

00:00:08.419 --> 00:00:11.994
Sales asks marketing. Marketing calls the analyst.

00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:13.644
Someone checks with the stores.

00:00:13.644 --> 00:00:16.769
Everyone knows a piece. Nobody has the full picture.

00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:23.200
The search begins. Sales reports, inventory, the campaign calendar.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.365
Then a conversation with the stores.

00:00:25.365 --> 00:00:28.608
Different systems. Different people. Another handoff.

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:33.215
The team is busy finding the story, instead of changing it.

00:00:33.215 --> 00:00:35.190
AI without business context

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.809
only sees part of the picture.

00:00:38.394 --> 00:00:42.994
Microsoft IQ. Unified intelligence for enterprise AI.

00:00:42.994 --> 00:00:45.532
Shared business understanding for people and agents.

00:00:46.394 --> 00:00:49.469
Work IQ understands how employees work.

00:00:49.469 --> 00:00:52.494
Fabric IQ brings meaning to business data.

00:00:52.494 --> 00:00:55.516
Foundry IQ helps agents unlock the right knowledge.

00:00:57.369 --> 00:01:00.884
Connect products, promotions, stock, and stores.

00:01:00.884 --> 00:01:04.084
Reveal business relationships, not just files.

00:01:04.084 --> 00:01:06.936
Then add work context and organizational knowledge.

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:11.369
The promotion ended. Stock is available.

00:01:11.369 --> 00:01:13.494
Customers still show interest.

00:01:13.494 --> 00:01:17.153
The evidence points to a hypothesis, with sources to inspect.

00:01:20.398 --> 00:01:23.173
Ask an agent to draft the next campaign.

00:01:23.173 --> 00:01:25.748
Use that insight, available products,

00:01:25.748 --> 00:01:27.873
and the brand's approved creative guidance.

00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:33.769
One brief. A coordinated campaign across email, social, and web.

00:01:33.769 --> 00:01:35.869
Same story. Same look.

00:01:35.869 --> 00:01:38.495
Creative work, grounded in what the business needs.

00:01:39.394 --> 00:01:43.944
Trust comes first. Permission-aware access. Traceable sources.

00:01:43.944 --> 00:01:46.569
People review and approve before publishing.

00:01:46.569 --> 00:01:47.791
Then measure what happens.

00:01:49.419 --> 00:01:51.994
Less searching. Shared understanding.

00:01:51.994 --> 00:01:54.977
More time for people to decide, create, and act.

00:01:56.444 --> 00:01:59.116
Microsoft IQ. From insight to impact.
